 requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-510\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 510. Procedures on opening balances, consistency of accounting policies, relevant information in the predecessor's report and reporting conclusions.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-510\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-520\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"520\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 520: Analytical procedures\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-520\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 520. Substantive analytical procedures, analytical procedures that assist when forming an overall conclusion, and investigation of results.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-520\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-530\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"530\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 530: Audit sampling\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-530\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 530. Sample design, size and selection, performing procedures, nature and cause of deviations and misstatements, projecting misstatements and evaluating results.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-530\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-540\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"540\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 540: Auditing accounting estimates and related disclosures\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-540\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 540. Risk assessment procedures for estimates, identification and assessment of risks including estimation uncertainty, responses (events after period end, testing management's process, developing a point estimate or range), disclosures, indicators of bias, overall evaluation, representations, communication and documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-540\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-550\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"550\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 550: Related parties\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-550\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 550. Risk assessment procedures and related activities, identification and assessment of risks, responses to significant related-party transactions outside the normal course of business, evaluation of accounting and disclosure, representations, communication and documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-550\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-560\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"560\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 560: Subsequent events\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-560\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 560. Events between the period end and the auditor's report date, facts that become known after the report date but before issue, and facts that become known after the financial statements have been issued.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-560\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-570\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"570\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 570: Going concern\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-570\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 570. Risk assessment procedures, evaluation of management's assessment, period beyond management's assessment, additional procedures when events or conditions are identified, conclusions, implications for the report, communication and delay in approval.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-570\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-580\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"580\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 580: Written representations\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-580\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 580. Management from whom representations are requested, representations about responsibilities and other representations, date and period covered, doubt as to reliability and refusal to provide representations.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-580\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-600\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"600\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 600: Special considerations: audits of group financial statements\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-600\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 600. Group engagement partner responsibilities, acceptance and continuance, overall strategy and plan, understanding the group and components, materiality, responding to assessed risks, component auditors, consolidation process, subsequent events, evaluation of evidence, communication and documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-600\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-610\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"610\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 610: Using the work of internal auditors\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-610\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 610. Determining whether, in which areas and to what extent the work of the internal audit function can be used; using internal auditors to provide direct assistance; documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-610\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-620\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"620\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 620: Using the work of an auditor's expert\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-620\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 620. Determining the need for an expert, nature timing and extent of procedures, competence capabilities and objectivity, understanding the field, agreement with the expert, evaluating adequacy of the expert's work, and reference in the report.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-620\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-700\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"700\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 700: Forming an opinion and reporting on financial statements\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-700\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 700. Forming the opinion, form of opinion, content and structure of the auditor's report, supplementary information.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-700\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-701\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"701\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 701: Communicating key audit matters\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-701\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 701. Determining key audit matters, communicating them in the report, communication with those charged with governance and documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-701\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-705\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"705\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 705: Modifications to the opinion\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-705\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 705. Circumstances when a modification is required, determining the type of modification (qualified, adverse, disclaimer), form and content of the report when the opinion is modified, communication with those charged with governance.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-705\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-706\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"706\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 706: Emphasis of matter and other matter paragraphs\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-706\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 706. When and how to include emphasis of matter and other matter paragraphs, and communication with those charged with governance.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-706\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-710\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"710\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 710: Comparative information\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-710\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 710. Audit procedures on corresponding figures and comparative financial statements, and audit reporting for each approach.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-710\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"},{\"id\":\"ESA-720\",\"family\":\"ESA\",\"number\":\"720\",\"title\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 720: The auditor's responsibilities relating to other information\",\"jurisdiction\":\"EG\",\"issuer\":\"Egyptian Standing Committee for Accounting and Auditing Standards (Ministry of Investment; reorganised under Prime Ministerial Decree 2115 of 2023)\",\"edition\":\"Egyptian Standards on Auditing, Limited Review and Other Assurance Engagements, issued by Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008 (38 standards, numbered to match the ISAs); replaced by the standards approved by Prime Ministerial Decree 3725 of 2025 from 1 January 2027.\",\"effective_note\":\"The 2008 standard applies to audits of periods beginning before 1 January 2027; the 2025 standard applies from 1 January 2027. Requirements are carried by reference to the equivalent ISA; where the Egyptian text departs from the ISA the departure is recorded on the requirement.\",\"equivalent_of\":\"ISA-720\",\"supersedes\":null,\"in_force\":1,\"scope\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 720. Obtaining the other information, reading and considering it, responding to material inconsistencies and misstatements, reporting and documentation.\",\"term_id\":\"T-STD-ESA-720\",\"scope_ar\":null,\"scope_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\"}]"),
    ("terms", 450, "[{\"id\":\"T-MATERIALITY\",\"en\":\"Materiality\",\"ar\":\"الأهمية النسبية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 320 title and paragraph 2; occurrences confirmed in the text: 207\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The magnitude of misstatement that could reasonably be expected to influence the economic decisions of users.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-320\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-PERFORMANCE-MATERIALITY\",\"en\":\"Performance materiality\",\"ar\":\"مادية الأداء\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Performance materiality\\\"; occurrences confirmed in the text: 2\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An amount below materiality set to reduce to an appropriately low level the probability that uncorrected and undetected misstatements exceed materiality in aggregate.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-320\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-MISSTATEMENT\",\"en\":\"Misstatement\",\"ar\":\"التحريف\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ط) (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 1173\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تحريف\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Misstatement\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A difference between a reported amount, classification, presentation or disclosure and what the framework requires.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-UNCORRECTED-MISSTATEMENT\",\"en\":\"Uncorrected misstatements\",\"ar\":\"التحريفات غير المصححة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 450 paragraph 4 (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 30\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Misstatements accumulated during the audit that have not been corrected.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-CLEARLY-TRIVIAL\",\"en\":\"Clearly trivial\",\"ar\":\"تافهة بشكل واضح\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 450 paragraph 5; occurrences confirmed in the text: 12; the standard uses the adjective phrase; the noun form for the threshold is the engine's label\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Misstatements below an amount that is clearly inconsequential, individually and in aggregate.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-GOING-CONCERN\",\"en\":\"Going concern\",\"ar\":\"الاستمرارية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 570 title and paragraph 2 (\\\"أساس الاستمرارية في المحاسبة\\\"); occurrences confirmed in the text: 151\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"المنشأة المستمرة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 570 title\",\"definition_en\":\"The basis of accounting under which the entity is viewed as continuing in business for the foreseeable future.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-570\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-MATERIAL-UNCERTAINTY\",\"en\":\"Material uncertainty related to going concern\",\"ar\":\"عدم تأكد جوهري متعلق بالاستمرارية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 570 paragraphs 18 and 22 (report section heading); occurrences confirmed in the text: 2\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Events or conditions whose potential impact and likelihood require disclosure for fair presentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-570\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-RMM\",\"en\":\"Risk of material misstatement\",\"ar\":\"خطر التحريف الجوهري\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ن) (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 63\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مخاطر التحريفات الجوهرية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Risk of material misstatement\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The risk that the financial statements are materially misstated before the audit, consisting of inherent risk and control risk.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-INHERENT-RISK\",\"en\":\"Inherent risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر الملازم\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ن)(1); occurrences confirmed in the text: 201\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مخاطر متأصلة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Inherent risk\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The susceptibility of an assertion to misstatement before consideration of controls.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-CONTROL-RISK\",\"en\":\"Control risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر الرقابة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ن)(2); occurrences confirmed in the text: 44\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مخاطر الرقابة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Control risk\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The risk that a misstatement will not be prevented or detected and corrected on a timely basis by internal control.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-DETECTION-RISK\",\"en\":\"Detection risk\",\"ar\":\"خطر الاكتشاف\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ه); occurrences confirmed in the text: 20\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مخاطر الكشف\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Detection risk\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The risk that the auditor's procedures will not detect a misstatement that exists.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SIGNIFICANT-RISK\",\"en\":\"Significant risk\",\"ar\":\"الخطر المهم\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 315 (Revised 2019) paragraph 12(ل) (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 3\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مخاطر هامة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Significant risk\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"An identified risk of material misstatement assessed close to the upper end of the spectrum of inherent risk.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-315\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-FRAUD\",\"en\":\"Fraud\",\"ar\":\"الغش\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 240 title and paragraph 12 (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 392\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"احتيال\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Fraud\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"An intentional act involving deception to obtain an unjust or illegal advantage.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-FRAUD-RISK-FACTOR\",\"en\":\"Fraud risk factors\",\"ar\":\"عوامل خطر الغش\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 240 paragraph 12 (definitions); occurrences confirmed in the text: 51\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"عوامل مخاطر الاحتيال\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Fraud risk factors\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Events or conditions that indicate an incentive or pressure to commit fraud or provide an opportunity to do so.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-AUDIT-EVIDENCE\",\"en\":\"Audit evidence\",\"ar\":\"أدلة المراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ب) and ISA 500 title; occurrences confirmed in the text: 790\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"دليل تدقيق\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Audit evidence\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Information used by the auditor in arriving at the conclusions on which the opinion is based.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SUFFICIENT-APPROPRIATE\",\"en\":\"Sufficient appropriate audit evidence\",\"ar\":\"ما يكفي من أدلة المراجعة المناسبة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 17 and ISA 500 paragraph 6; occurrences confirmed in the text: 297\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"كفاية (أدلة التدقيق)\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entries \\\"Sufficiency\\\" and \\\"Appropriateness\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Evidence adequate in quantity and of the relevance and reliability needed to support the opinion.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-AUDIT-SAMPLING\",\"en\":\"Audit sampling\",\"ar\":\"العينات في المراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 530 title; occurrences confirmed in the text: 23\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"أخذ عينات تدقيق\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Audit sampling\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Applying procedures to less than the whole population so that every sampling unit has a chance of selection.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SAMPLING-RISK\",\"en\":\"Sampling risk\",\"ar\":\"مخاطر أخذ عينات (المعاينة)\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Sampling risk\\\"; occurrences confirmed in the text: 1\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The risk that the conclusion from a sample differs from the conclusion had the whole population been tested.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-TOLERABLE-MISSTATEMENT\",\"en\":\"Tolerable misstatement\",\"ar\":\"الخطأ المسموح به\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Tolerable misstatement\\\"; occurrences confirmed in the text: 1\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A monetary amount set by the auditor to obtain assurance that actual misstatement in the population does not exceed it.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-TOLERABLE-RATE\",\"en\":\"Tolerable rate of deviation\",\"ar\":\"معدل إنحراف مسموح به\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf); Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Tolerable rate of deviation\\\" (spelling as printed); occurrences confirmed in the text: 1\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A rate of deviation from prescribed controls set by the auditor to obtain assurance that the actual rate does not exceed it.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ANALYTICAL-PROCEDURES\",\"en\":\"Analytical procedures\",\"ar\":\"الإجراءات التحليلية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 520 title and paragraph 4; occurrences confirmed in the text: 103\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"إجراءات تحليلية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Analytical procedures\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Evaluations of financial information through analysis of plausible relationships among financial and non-financial data.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-520\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EXTERNAL-CONFIRMATION\",\"en\":\"External confirmation\",\"ar\":\"المصادقة الخارجية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 505 paragraph 6(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 37\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مصادقة خارجية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"External confirmation\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Audit evidence obtained as a direct written response from a third party.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-505\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ACCOUNTING-ESTIMATE\",\"en\":\"Accounting estimate\",\"ar\":\"التقدير المحاسبي\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 540 (Revised) paragraph 12(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 100\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تقدير محاسبي\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Accounting estimate\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A monetary amount for which measurement is subject to estimation uncertainty.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-540\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ESTIMATION-UNCERTAINTY\",\"en\":\"Estimation uncertainty\",\"ar\":\"شكوك التقدير\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Estimation uncertainty\\\"; occurrences confirmed in the text: 11\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Susceptibility to an inherent lack of precision in measurement.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-540\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-MANAGEMENT-BIAS\",\"en\":\"Management bias\",\"ar\":\"تحيز الإدارة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 540 (Revised) paragraph 12(د); occurrences confirmed in the text: 54\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تحيز الإدارة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Management bias\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A lack of neutrality by management in the preparation of information.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-540\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-RELATED-PARTY\",\"en\":\"Related party\",\"ar\":\"الطرف ذو العلاقة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 550 paragraph 10(ب) and title (الأطراف ذات العلاقة); occurrences confirmed in the text: 3\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"طرف ذو علاقة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Related party\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A party related to the entity as defined by the applicable framework or the standard's own definition.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-550\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-TCWG\",\"en\":\"Those charged with governance\",\"ar\":\"المكلفون بالحوكمة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(س) and ISA 260 paragraph 10(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 145\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"أولئك المكلفون بالحوكمة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Those charged with governance\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The persons or organisations responsible for overseeing the strategic direction and accountability of the entity.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-260\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-WRITTEN-REPRESENTATION\",\"en\":\"Written representations\",\"ar\":\"الإفادات المكتوبة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 580 title and paragraph 7; occurrences confirmed in the text: 141\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"إقرار خطي\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Written representation\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A written statement by management provided to the auditor to confirm matters or support other evidence.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-580\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SUBSEQUENT-EVENTS\",\"en\":\"Subsequent events\",\"ar\":\"الأحداث اللاحقة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 560 title and paragraph 5(ه); occurrences confirmed in the text: 47\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"أحداث لاحقة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Subsequent events\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Events occurring between the date of the financial statements and the date of the auditor's report, and facts that become known after that date.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-560\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-KEY-AUDIT-MATTER\",\"en\":\"Key audit matters\",\"ar\":\"الأمور الرئيسة للمراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 701 title and paragraph 8; occurrences confirmed in the text: 275\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مسائل التدقيق الرئيسية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Key audit matters\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Matters that, in the auditor's judgment, were of most significance in the audit of the current period.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-701\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-QUALIFIED-OPINION\",\"en\":\"Qualified opinion\",\"ar\":\"رأي متحفظ\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 705 paragraph 7; occurrences confirmed in the text: 39\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"رأي متحفظ\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Modified opinion\\\" (رأي متحفظ أو رأي سلبي أو حجب الرأي)\",\"definition_en\":\"A modified opinion expressed when misstatements or possible effects are material but not pervasive.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-705\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ADVERSE-OPINION\",\"en\":\"Adverse opinion\",\"ar\":\"رأي معارض\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 705 paragraph 8; occurrences confirmed in the text: 32\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"رأي سلبي\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Modified opinion\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A modified opinion expressed when misstatements are material and pervasive.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-705\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-DISCLAIMER\",\"en\":\"Disclaimer of opinion\",\"ar\":\"الامتناع عن إبداء الرأي\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 705 paragraph 9; occurrences confirmed in the text: 13\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"حجب الرأي\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Modified opinion\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The auditor does not express an opinion because sufficient evidence could not be obtained and possible effects are material and pervasive.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-705\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EMPHASIS-OF-MATTER\",\"en\":\"Emphasis of matter paragraph\",\"ar\":\"فقرة لفت الانتباه\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 706 title and paragraph 7(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 17\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"فقرة تأكيد الموضوع\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Emphasis of Matter paragraph\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A paragraph referring to a matter disclosed in the financial statements that is fundamental to users' understanding.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-706\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-PROFESSIONAL-SCEPTICISM\",\"en\":\"Professional scepticism\",\"ar\":\"نزعة الشك المهني\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ل); occurrences confirmed in the text: 121\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تشكيك مهني\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Professional skepticism\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"An attitude including a questioning mind and critical assessment of evidence.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-PROFESSIONAL-JUDGMENT\",\"en\":\"Professional judgment\",\"ar\":\"الحكم المهني\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 13(ك); occurrences confirmed in the text: 105\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"حكم مهني\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Professional judgment\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The application of relevant training, knowledge and experience in making informed decisions.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-INTERNAL-CONTROL\",\"en\":\"System of internal control\",\"ar\":\"نظام الرقابة الداخلية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 315 (Revised 2019) paragraph 12(م); occurrences confirmed in the text: 206\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"رقابة داخلية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Internal control\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The system designed, implemented and maintained to address business risks that threaten the achievement of financial reporting objectives.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-315\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-CONTROL-DEFICIENCY\",\"en\":\"Deficiency in internal control\",\"ar\":\"أوجه القصور في الرقابة الداخلية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 265 title and paragraph 6(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 31\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"القصور في أنظمة الرقابة الداخلية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Deficiency in internal control\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A control that is missing or does not operate so as to prevent or detect misstatements on a timely basis.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-265\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SIGNIFICANT-DEFICIENCY\",\"en\":\"Significant deficiency in internal control\",\"ar\":\"أوجه القصور المهمة في الرقابة الداخلية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 265 paragraph 6(ب); occurrences confirmed in the text: 14\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"قصور هام في نظام الرقابة الداخلي\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Significant deficiency in internal control\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"A deficiency or combination of sufficient importance to merit the attention of those charged with governance.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-265\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-TEST-OF-CONTROLS\",\"en\":\"Tests of controls\",\"ar\":\"اختبارات أدوات الرقابة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 330 paragraph 4(ب); occurrences confirmed in the text: 60\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"اختبارات أنظمة الرقابة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Tests of controls\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Procedures designed to evaluate the operating effectiveness of controls.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-330\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SUBSTANTIVE-PROCEDURE\",\"en\":\"Substantive procedures\",\"ar\":\"الإجراءات الأساس\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 330 paragraph 4(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 114\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Procedures designed to detect material misstatements at the assertion level, comprising tests of details and substantive analytical procedures.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-330\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ENGAGEMENT-PARTNER\",\"en\":\"Engagement partner\",\"ar\":\"الشريك المسؤول عن الارتباط\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 220 (Revised) paragraph 12(أ); occurrences confirmed in the text: 231\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"شريك العملية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Engagement partner\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The partner responsible for the engagement and the report issued on behalf of the firm.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-220\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EQR\",\"en\":\"Engagement quality review\",\"ar\":\"فحص جودة الارتباط\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 2 paragraph 13(ب) and ISA 220 (Revised) paragraph 12; occurrences confirmed in the text: 26\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مراجعة رقابة جودة العملية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Engagement quality control review\\\" (pre-ISQM term)\",\"definition_en\":\"An objective evaluation of the significant judgments and conclusions of the engagement team performed by the reviewer.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-2\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-INDEPENDENCE\",\"en\":\"Independence\",\"ar\":\"الاستقلال\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 14 (\\\"المتطلبات المسلكية ذات الصلة، بما فيها تلك المتعلقة بالاستقلال\\\"); occurrences confirmed in the text: 205\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"الاستقلالية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Independence\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"Independence of mind and in appearance as required by the International Independence Standards.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"IESBA-CODE\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-TRIAL-BALANCE\",\"en\":\"Trial balance\",\"ar\":\"ميزان المراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key nav.trialBalance\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The list of every ledger account with its closing debit or credit balance for a period.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LEADSHEET\",\"en\":\"Leadsheet\",\"ar\":\"كشف الحسابات\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key workingPapers.leadsheet\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The working paper that groups the trial balance accounts for one financial statement area and carries the audit conclusion for it.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-WORKING-PAPER\",\"en\":\"Working papers\",\"ar\":\"أوراق العمل\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 230 paragraph 6(أ) (the definition notes the term is also used); occurrences confirmed in the text: 17\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"وثائق تدقيق\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary entry \\\"Audit documentation\\\"\",\"definition_en\":\"The audit documentation of procedures performed, evidence obtained and conclusions reached.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-230\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-DEBIT\",\"en\":\"Debit\",\"ar\":\"مدين\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key trialBalance.debit\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The left-hand side of an entry; increases assets and expenses.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-CREDIT\",\"en\":\"Credit\",\"ar\":\"دائن\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key trialBalance.credit\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The right-hand side of an entry; increases liabilities, equity and income.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-CHART-OF-ACCOUNTS\",\"en\":\"Chart of accounts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The numbered list of ledger accounts used by an entity.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-ENGAGEMENT\",\"en\":\"Audit engagement\",\"ar\":\"ارتباط المراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 200 paragraph 14 and ISA 210 title (ارتباطات المراجعة); occurrences confirmed in the text: 258\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"عملية تدقيق\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; glossary; the product glossary renders it عملية التدقيق (tier 2, kept in ar_alt_source note)\",\"definition_en\":\"An engagement to express an opinion on financial statements in accordance with the ISAs.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-200\",\"en\":\"Overall objectives of the independent auditor and the conduct of an audit\",\"ar\":\"الأهداف العامة للمراجع المستقل والقيام بالمراجعة وفقا للمعايير الدولية للمراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 200 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 42\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"الأهداف العامة للمدقق المستقل وإجراء عملية تدقيق وفقا لمعايير التدقيق الدولية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 200\",\"definition_en\":\"Overall objectives, ethical requirements, professional scepticism and judgment, sufficient appropriate evidence, and conduct of an audit in accordance with the ISAs.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-200\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-210\",\"en\":\"Agreeing the terms of audit engagements\",\"ar\":\"الاتفاق على شروط ارتباطات المراجعة\",\"ar_status\":\