s; contents, ISA 300\",\"definition_en\":\"Involvement of key engagement team members, preliminary engagement activities, overall audit strategy and audit plan, changes during the audit, direction and supervision, initial engagement considerations and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-300\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-315\",\"en\":\"Identifying and assessing the risks of material misstatement\",\"ar\":\"التعرف على مخاطر التحريف الجوهري وتقييمها\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 315 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 90\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تحديد وتقييم مخاطر الخطأ الجوهري\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 315\",\"definition_en\":\"Risk assessment procedures, understanding the entity and its environment, the applicable framework and the system of internal control, identification and assessment of risks at the financial-statement and assertion levels, significant risks, stand-back and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-315\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-320\",\"en\":\"Materiality in planning and performing an audit\",\"ar\":\"الأهمية النسبية عند التخطيط للمراجعة وتنفيذها\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 320 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 2\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"الأهمية النسبية في تخطيط وأداء عملية تدقيق\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 320\",\"definition_en\":\"Materiality for the financial statements as a whole, materiality for particular classes of transactions, balances or disclosures, performance materiality, revision during the audit and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-320\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-330\",\"en\":\"The auditor's responses to assessed risks\",\"ar\":\"استجابات المراجع للمخاطر المقيمة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 330 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 9\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"استجابة المدقق للمخاطر المقيمة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 330\",\"definition_en\":\"Overall responses, further audit procedures responsive to assessed risks, tests of controls, substantive procedures, adequacy of presentation, sufficiency of evidence and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-330\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-402\",\"en\":\"Audit considerations relating to an entity using a service organization\",\"ar\":\"اعتبارات التدقيق المتعلقة بالمنشآت التي تستعمل مؤسسات خدمية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 402; occurrences confirmed in the text: 2\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Understanding services provided, responding to assessed risks including use of type 1 and type 2 reports, and reporting.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-402\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-450\",\"en\":\"Evaluation of misstatements identified during the audit\",\"ar\":\"تقييم البيانات الخاطئة المحددة خلال عملية التدقيق\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 450; occurrences confirmed in the text: 15\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Accumulation of misstatements, consideration as the audit progresses, communication and correction, evaluation of the effect of uncorrected misstatements, written representations and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-501\",\"en\":\"Audit evidence: specific considerations for selected items\",\"ar\":\"أدلة التدقيق - اعتبارات محددة لبنود مختارة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 501; occurrences confirmed in the text: 1\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Inventory (attendance at physical counting), litigation and claims, and segment information.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-501\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-505\",\"en\":\"External confirmations\",\"ar\":\"المصادقات الخارجية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 505 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 15\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"المصادقات الخارجية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 505\",\"definition_en\":\"Design and control of confirmation requests, management refusal, reliability of responses, non-responses, negative confirmations and evaluation of evidence obtained.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-505\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-510\",\"en\":\"Initial audit engagements: opening balances\",\"ar\":\"ارتباطات المراجعة لأول مرة - الأرصدة الافتتاحية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 510 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 7\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Procedures on opening balances, consistency of accounting policies, relevant information in the predecessor's report and reporting conclusions.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-510\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-540\",\"en\":\"Auditing accounting estimates and related disclosures\",\"ar\":\"مراجعة التقديرات المحاسبية وما يتعلق بها من إفصاحات\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 540 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 13\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تدقيق التقديرات المحاسبية والإفصاحات ذات العلاقة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 540\",\"definition_en\":\"Risk assessment procedures for estimates, identification and assessment of risks including estimation uncertainty, responses (events after period end, testing management's process, developing a point estimate or range), disclosures, indicators of bias, overall evaluation, representations, communication and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-540\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-550\",\"en\":\"Related parties\",\"ar\":\"الأطراف ذات العلاقة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 550 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 220\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"الأطراف ذات العلاقة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 550\",\"definition_en\":\"Risk assessment procedures and related activities, identification and assessment of risks, responses to significant related-party transactions outside the normal course of business, evaluation of accounting and disclosure, representations, communication and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-550\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-600\",\"en\":\"Special considerations: audits of group financial statements\",\"ar\":\"الاعتبارات الخاصة – عمليات تدقيق البيانات المالية للمجموعة (بما في ذلك عمل مدققي العنصر)\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 600; occurrences confirmed in the text: 4\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Group engagement partner responsibilities, acceptance and continuance, overall strategy and plan, understanding the group and components, materiality, responding to assessed risks, component auditors, consolidation process, subsequent events, evaluation of evidence, communication and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-600\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-610\",\"en\":\"Using the work of internal auditors\",\"ar\":\"استخدام عمل المراجعين الداخليين\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 610 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 16\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"استخدام عمل المدققين الداخليين\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 610\",\"definition_en\":\"Determining whether, in which areas and to what extent the work of the internal audit function can be used; using internal auditors to provide direct assistance; documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-610\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-620\",\"en\":\"Using the work of an auditor's expert\",\"ar\":\"استخدام عمل خبير استعان به المراجع\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 620 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 9\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"استخدام عمل مدقق خبير\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 620\",\"definition_en\":\"Determining the need for an expert, nature timing and extent of procedures, competence capabilities and objectivity, understanding the field, agreement with the expert, evaluating adequacy of the expert's work, and reference in the report.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-620\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-700\",\"en\":\"Forming an opinion and reporting on financial statements\",\"ar\":\"تكوين الرأي والتقرير عن القوائم المالية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 700 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 28\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"تكوين رأي وإعداد التقارير حول البيانات المالية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 700\",\"definition_en\":\"Forming the opinion, form of opinion, content and structure of the auditor's report, supplementary information.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-700\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-701\",\"en\":\"Communicating key audit matters\",\"ar\":\"الإبلاغ عن الأمور الرئيسة للمراجعة في تقرير المراجع المستقل\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 701 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 22\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"الإبلاغ عن مسائل التدقيق الرئيسية في تقرير المدقق المستقل\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 701\",\"definition_en\":\"Determining key audit matters, communicating them in the report, communication with those charged with governance and documen