a\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); title of ISA 240 as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 21; the revised standard carries the same title\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"مسؤوليات المدقق المتعلقة بالاحتيال في عملية تدقيق البيانات المالية\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 240\",\"definition_en\":\"Revised fraud standard: strengthened scepticism, fraud risk assessment and response requirements, communication and transparency in the auditor's report.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240R\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISA-570R\",\"en\":\"Going concern (Revised 2024)\",\"ar\":\"الاستمرارية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISA 570 title and paragraph 2 (\\\"أساس الاستمرارية في المحاسبة\\\"); occurrences confirmed in the text: 151; the revised standard carries the same title\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":\"المنشأة المستمرة\",\"ar_alt_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms; contents, ISA 570 title\",\"definition_en\":\"Revised going concern standard: enhanced risk assessment, evaluation of management's assessment over at least twelve months from the date of approval, evaluation of disclosures, and expanded reporting including material uncertainty and close-call disclosures.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-570R\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISQM-1\",\"en\":\"Quality management for firms that perform audits or reviews\",\"ar\":\"إدارة الجودة للمكاتب التي تنفذ ارتباطات مراجعة أو فحص القوائم المالية أو ارتباطات التأكيد الأخرى أو ارتباطات الخدمات ذات العلاقة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 title as quoted in the handbook text; occurrences confirmed in the text: 11\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Firm-level system of quality management: governance and leadership, risk assessment process, ethical requirements, acceptance and continuance, engagement performance, resources, information and communication, monitoring and remediation, network requirements, evaluation and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ISQM-2\",\"en\":\"Engagement quality reviews\",\"ar\":\"فحص جودة الارتباطات\",\"ar_status\":\"derived\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 3 — derived: plural of the Tier 1 defined term for the standard whose subject it is\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Appointment and eligibility of engagement quality reviewers, performance of the review, and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-2\",\"ar_tier\":3,\"derived_from\":\"[\\\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Han