ase, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-260: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) title page; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 260. Identification of those charged with governance, matters to be communicated, the communication process and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ESA-260\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ESA-265\",\"en\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 265: Communicating deficiencies in internal control\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-265: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) title page; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 265. Determination of whether deficiencies are significant, and written communication of significant deficiencies to those charged with governance and management.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_a