 of ISA 402. Understanding services provided, responding to assessed risks including use of type 1 and type 2 reports, and reporting.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ESA-402\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ESA-450\",\"en\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 450: Evaluation of misstatements identified during the audit\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-450: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) title page; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 450. Accumulation of misstatements, consideration as the audit progresses, communication and correction, evaluation of the effect of uncorrected misstatements, written representations and documentation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ESA-450\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ESA-500\",\"en\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 500: Audit evidence\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-500: SOCPA 