se, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-505: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) title page; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 505. Design and control of confirmation requests, management refusal, reliability of responses, non-responses, negative confirmations and evaluation of evidence obtained.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ESA-505\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-STD-ESA-510\",\"en\":\"Egyptian Standard on Auditing 510: Initial audit engagements: opening balances\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ESA-510: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) title page; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Egyptian adaptation of ISA 510. Procedures on opening balances, consistency of accounting policies, relevant information in the predecessor's report and reporting conclusions.\",\"definitio