S\",\"en\":\"Cost of sales\",\"ar\":\"تكلفة المبيعات\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): backend/src/financial_statements.rs, key IS_COGS\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Cost of goods sold and direct cost of services, including inventory write-downs.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LS-OPEX\",\"en\":\"Operating expenses\",\"ar\":\"المصروفات التشغيلية\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): backend/FinancialStatements.mo, key PL_OPERATING_EXPENSES\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Distribution and administrative expenses other than staff costs, depreciation and amortisation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LS-STAFF\",\"en\":\"Staff costs\",\"ar\":\"رواتب وأجور\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts, key 5100; product EN \\\"Salaries and Wages\\\"; applied to the leadsheet \\\"Staff costs\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Wages, salaries, bonuses, social insurance, pension and other employee benefit expense.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LS-DEPR\",\"en\":\"Depreciation and amortisation\",\"ar\":\"الإهلاك والاستهلاك\",\"ar_status\":\"derived\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 3 — derived by analogy from sourced components; compound of the sourced \\\"depreciation\\\" and \\\"amortisation\\\" nouns\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Depreciation of property, plant and equipment and right-of-use assets; amortisation of intangibles.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":3,\"derived_from\":\"[\\\"frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts:5300 = مصروف إهلاك\\\", \\\"frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts:5310 = مصروف استهلاك\\\"]\"},{\"id\":\"T-LS-IMP\",\"en\":\"Impairment losses\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Impairment of non-financial assets and goodwill; expected credit loss expense is presented here where the framework requires a separate line.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LS-OEXP\",\"en\":\"Other expenses\",\"ar\":\"مصروفات أخرى\",\"ar_status\":\"derived\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 3 — derived by analogy from sourced components; \\\"other\\\" (أخرى) taken from \\\"other income\\\" and applied to \\\"expenses\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Losses on disposal, exceptional items, donations and other operating expenses not classified elsewhere.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":3,\"derived_from\":\"[\\\"frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts:comment = المصروفات\\\", \\\"frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts:4500 = إيرادات أخرى\\\"]\"},{\"id\":\"T-LS-FINC\",\"en\":\"Finance costs\",\"ar\":\"تكاليف التمويل\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): backend/src/financial_statements.rs, key IS_INTEREST; product EN \\\"Finance Costs\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Interest expense, lease interest, unwinding of discounts, fair value losses, foreign exchange losses on financing.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-LS-TAXEXP\",\"en\":\"Income tax expense\",\"ar\":\"ضريبة الدخل\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/data/egyptianChartOfAccounts.ts, key 6300; product EN \\\"Corporate Income Tax\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Current and deferred income tax expense or credit.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-C-MATERIALITY\",\"en\":\"Materiality determination\",\"ar\":\"تحديد الأهمية النسبية\",\"ar_status\":\"derived\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 3 — derived by analogy from sourced components; \\\"materiality\\\" + \\\"determination\\\" (تحديد), both sourced\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Overall materiality from a benchmark and percentage, performance materiality as a bounded factor, the clearly trivial threshold, specific materiality levels, and the revision test that flags when procedures must be reconsidered.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-320\",\"ar_tier\":3,\"derived_from\":\"[\\\"frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json:egyptianStandards.templateNames.materialityMemo = مذكرة الأهمية النسبية\\\", \\\"frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json:egyptianStandards.isa315 = تحديد وتقييم مخاطر الأخطاء الجوهرية\\\"]\"},{\"id\":\"T-C-MUS\",\"en\":\"Monetary unit sampling for tests of details\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-530: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements paragraphs on monetary unit sampling for tests of details; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Sample size from exactly solved Poisson reliability factors, systematic selection with a top stratum, and Stringer-bound evaluation of overstatements.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-C-ATTRIBUTE\",\"en\":\"Attribute sampling for tests of controls\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-530: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements paragraphs on attribute sampling for tests of controls; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Exact binomial sample size for a tolerable deviation rate and risk of overreliance, and the upper deviation limit achieved by the sample.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-C-ANALYTICS\",\"en\":\"Substantive and final analytical procedures\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-520: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements paragraphs on substantive and final analytical procedures; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Expectation models (prior growth, driver product, ratio to base, proof in total), a threshold derived from performance materiality, difference evaluation, and the standard ratio set.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-520\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-C-AGGREGATION\",\"en\":\"Aggregation and evaluation of misstatements\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-450: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements paragraphs on aggregation and evaluation of misstatements; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Accumulation of misstatements above the clearly trivial threshold by type and status, balanced-entry checks, element totals, rollover and iron-curtain evaluation, and comparison with materiality.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-C-GOING-CONCERN\",\"en\":\"Going concern assessment arithmetic\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-570: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements paragraphs on going concern assessment arithmetic; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Assessment period coverage under the extant and the 2024 revised standard, cash flow forecast headroom including undrawn facilities, first breach month in base and stress cases, and covenant tests.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-570\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-001\",\"en\":\"Client acceptance and continuance evaluation\",\"ar\":\"قبول العميل\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key clientAcceptance.title; product EN \\\"Client Acceptance\\\"; applied to \\\"Client acceptance and continuance evaluation\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Decide whether the firm may accept or continue the engagement.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-002\",\"en\":\"Independence and ethics confirmation\",\"ar\":\"تهديدات الاستقلالية\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key clientAcceptance.independenceThreats; product EN \\\"Independence Threats\\\"; applied to \\\"Independence and ethics confirmation\\\"; flagged\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Confirm that the team, firm and network are independent and ethical requirements are met.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-003\",\"en\":\"Engagement letter and preconditions\",\"ar\":\"خطاب الارتباط\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key egyptianStandards.templateNames.engagementLetter; product EN \\\"Engagement Letter\\\"; a