-TAX-003\",\"en\":\"Tax provisions and uncertain positions\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Evaluate provisions for open tax years and uncertain tax treatments.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-TAX-004\",\"en\":\"VAT reconciliation to returns and e-invoicing\",\"ar\":\"ضريبة القيمة المضافة\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key tax.vat; product EN \\\"Value Added Tax\\\"; applied to \\\"VAT reconciliation to returns and e-invoicing\\\"; flagged: narrower\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Obtain evidence over VAT liabilities and their consistency with revenue and purchases.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-TAX-005\",\"en\":\"Withholding tax compliance\",\"ar\":\"الضريبة المستقطعة من المنبع\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key tax.withholdingTax; product EN \\\"Withholding Tax\\\"; applied to \\\"Withholding tax compliance\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Obtain evidence that withholding tax is deducted, remitted and recorded.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-053\",\"en\":\"Facts becoming known after the report date\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-560: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Respond to facts that become known after the auditor's report is dated, before or after issue of the financial statements.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-560\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-054\",\"en\":\"Interim procedures roll-forward and reliance on prior-period control evidence\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-330: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Extend interim conclusions to the period end and justify any reliance on controls tested in prior audits.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-330\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-FSL-055\",\"en\":\"Special purpose, single statement and summary financial statement engagements\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-800: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Apply the additional acceptance, performance and reporting considerations for special purpose frameworks, single statements or elements, and summary financial statements.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-800\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-P-PUR-012\",\"en\":\"Prepayments and advances testing\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Obtain evidence over prepaid expenses and advances to suppliers.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-001\",\"en\":\"Management override of controls\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-240: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Management can manipulate records and prepare fraudulent statements by overriding controls that otherwise operate; the risk is present in every entity and is a significant risk by standard.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-002\",\"en\":\"Fraudulent financial reporting incentives\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Incentives or pressures such as covenant headroom, bonus targets, listing or financing needs create a risk of misstatement across the statements.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-003\",\"en\":\"Going concern uncertainty\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-570: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Events or conditions such as losses, negative cash flows, covenant breaches or loss of financing cast doubt on the ability to continue as a going concern and affect the basis of preparation and disclosures.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-570\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-004\",\"en\":\"Weak control environment\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A control environment that does not support integrity, competence and oversight undermines every other component and raises the risk of undetected misstatement pervasively.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-005\",\"en\":\"Risks arising from the use of IT\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Unrestricted access, unauthorised program changes or failed interfaces can cause systematic misstatement of automated processing and undermine application controls relied on.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-006\",\"en\":\"Undisclosed related parties and transactions\",\"ar\":\"الأطراف ذات الصلة\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key conflictCheck.relatedParties; product EN \\\"Related Parties\\\"; applied to the risk \\\"Undisclosed related parties and transactions\\\"; flagged: narrower\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Related-party relationships and transactions, especially with a dominant owner-manager, may be undisclosed or conducted on non-market terms and concealed within ordinary captions.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-550\",\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-007\",\"en\":\"Non-compliance with laws and regulations\",\"ar\":\"عدم الامتثال\",\"ar_status\":\"existing_product\",\"ar_source\":\"Tier 2 — AuditorBox reference frontend (Mercatura Forum, deployed, human-authored EN+AR): frontend/src/i18n/locales/ar.json, key egyptianStandards.templateNames.noncomplianceMemo; component of \\\"مذكرة عدم الامتثال\\\" (Non-Compliance Memo); applied to \\\"Non-compliance with laws and regulations\\\"\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Non-compliance with tax, companies, labour, sector or e-invoicing law can produce unrecorded liabilities, penalties, or consequences that affect the statements or the entity's ability to operate.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":2,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-008\",\"en\":\"Complex or judgmental accounting estimates\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-540: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Estimates with high estimation uncertainty, complexity or subjectivity (expected credit losses, impairment, provisions, fair values, deferred tax recoverability) are susceptible to error and bias.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-540\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-009\",\"en\":\"Financial statement closing and disclosure errors\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Manual consolidation, top-side adjustments, spreadsheet-based closing and complex disclosure requirements create a risk that the statements do not agree with the records or omit required disclosures.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-FSL-010\",\"en\":\"Group consolidation errors\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Omitted components, incorrect eliminations, inconsistent policies and differing period ends can misstate the group financial statements.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-REV-001\",\"en\":\"Revenue recognised before control transfers (cut-off and occurrence)\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. Official Arabic text of ISA-240: SOCPA translation of the IAASB 2023-2024 Handbook (Arabic edition, available on iaasb.org behind registration) requirements section; and the Egyptian Standard on Auditing of the same number (Ministerial Decree 166 of 2008; 2025 standards effective 2027-01-01) for the Egyptian rendering.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Sales recorded before delivery or service completion, bill-and-hold, side agreements and post-period reversals overstate revenue; presumed fraud risk under the standard.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-REV-002\",\"en\":\"Fictitious or overstated sales\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Sales to fictitious customers, duplicate invoices or inflated prices overstate revenue and receivables.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-REV-003\",\"en\":\"Incomplete revenue and cash receipts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Unrecorded cash sales, unbilled deliveries and diverted receipts understate revenue and receivables, particularly in cash-intensive businesses.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-REV-004\",\"en\":\"Expected credit loss allowance misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The loss allowance depends on ageing accuracy, historical loss rates and forward-looking assumptions and is susceptible to bias toward lower provisions.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-REV-005\",\"en\":\"Contract balances misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Over-time revenue measured on progress estimates, deferred revenue release and customer advances are susceptible to error in timing and amount.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PUR-001\",\"en\":\"Unrecorded liabilities and accruals\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Invoices received after the period end, unmatched receipts and unaccrued services understate payables and expenses.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PUR-002\",\"en\":\"Fictitious or duplicate purchases and payments\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Payments to fictitious suppliers, duplicate invoices or unauthorised purchases misappropriate assets and overstate expenses.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PUR-003\",\"en\":\"Provisions incomplete or misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Obligations from litigation, warranties, restructuring and onerous contracts may be unrecognised or measured without adequate support.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PUR-004\",\"en\":\"Expense misclassification and capitalisation\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Expenses may be capitalised to improve results, or capital items expensed, and costs allocated to the wrong captions.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PAY-001\",\"en\":\"Fictitious employees and unauthorised pay\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Ghost employees, leavers still paid and unauthorised rate changes overstate staff costs and misappropriate cash.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PAY-002\",\"en\":\"Payroll liabilities and statutory contributions incomplete\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Social insurance, payroll tax, bonus, leave and end-of-service obligations may be unrecorded or miscalculated.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-INV-001\",\"en\":\"Inventory does not exist or is in poor condition\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Recorded inventory may not exist, may be damaged or obsolete, or may be held by third parties without adequate evidence.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-INV-002\",\"en\":\"Inventory cost misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Cost formulas, overhead absorption, standard cost variances and by-product allocations are susceptible to error.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-INV-003\",\"en\":\"Net realisable value below cost\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Slow-moving, obsolete or price-eroded inventory may be carried above net realisable value; the write-down is an estimate susceptible to bias.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-INV-004\",\"en\":\"Inventory cut-off inconsistent with purchases and sales\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Goods in transit and period-end movements may be counted without the corresponding liability or sale, or vice versa.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PPE-001\",\"en\":\"Additions do not exist or are not capitalisable\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Recorded additions may be fictitious, may include costs that should be expensed, or may belong to related parties.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PPE-002\",\"en\":\"Depreciation and useful lives misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Useful lives, residual values and methods may not reflect consumption, and the register may not reconcile to the ledger.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PPE-003\",\"en\":\"Impairment not recognised\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Indicators of impairment may be ignored, or value-in-use models may use unsupported assumptions, leaving assets and goodwill overstated.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-PPE-004\",\"en\":\"Lease accounting incomplete or mismeasured\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Leases may be omitted from the register, or right-of-use assets and liabilities measured with wrong terms or rates.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-TRE-001\",\"en\":\"Cash misappropriation and unrecorded bank accounts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Cash may be diverted, bank accounts omitted from the records, or reconciliations manipulated to conceal shortages.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-TRE-002\",\"en\":\"Borrowings misclassified or covenants breached\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Breached covenants without waivers require current classification and may indicate going concern issues; accrued interest and fees may be misstated.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-TRE-003\",\"en\":\"Investments and financial instruments mismeasured\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Classification under the financial instruments framework and fair values from models or inactive markets are complex and judgmental.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-EQY-001\",\"en\":\"Equity transactions not authorised or reserves non-compliant\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Capital changes, dividends and reserve transfers may lack the required approvals or breach the companies law and articles.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-TAX-001\",\"en\":\"Income tax computation and deferred tax misstated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Tax adjustments, rate changes, loss recoverability and uncertain positions make the tax charge and balances susceptible to error and bias.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-R-TAX-002\",\"en\":\"VAT and withholding tax non-compliance\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_source\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"Tier 1 (IFAC translations database, SOCPA, Egyptian standards) not obtainable from the authoring environment on 2026-09-09; Tier 2 (AuditorBox product glossary, chart of accounts, financial statement lines) has no entry; Tier 3 derivation not possible without sourced components. No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry. Supply from the Egyptian Society of Accountants and Auditors terminology, the SOCPA glossary of audit terms, or a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice; cite the source.\",\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Output VAT not reconciled to e-invoicing submissions, input VAT overclaimed, or withholding not deducted creates unrecorded liabilities and penalties.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_tier\":null,\"derived_from\":null},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-LEAD\",\"en\":\"Responsibilities and leadership accountability\",\"ar\":\"المسؤوليات\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 20 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 108\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Who is ultimately and operationally accountable for the system, and the understanding, authority, time and lines of communication they must have.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-RISK\",\"en\":\"The firm's risk assessment process\",\"ar\":\"آلية تقييم المخاطر\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 23 heading (آلية المكتب لتقييم المخاطر); occurrences confirmed in the text: 9\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The process that establishes quality objectives, identifies and assesses quality risks, designs responses, and detects when they must change.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-GOV\",\"en\":\"Governance and leadership\",\"ar\":\"الحوكمة والقيادة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 28 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 13\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The culture, accountability, structure and resourcing decisions that set the environment for the system.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-ETH\",\"en\":\"Relevant ethical requirements\",\"ar\":\"المتطلبات المسلكية ذات الصلة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 29 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 208\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Understanding and fulfilment of ethical requirements including independence by the firm, its personnel, the network and service providers.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-ACC\",\"en\":\"Acceptance and continuance\",\"ar\":\"القبول والاستمرار\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 30 heading (قبول العلاقات مع العملاء وقبول كل ارتباط معين والاستمرار في تلك العلاقات والارتباطات); the short form appears in ISA 220 (Revised) as \\\"آلية القبول والاستمرار\\\"; occurrences confirmed in the text: 15\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Judgments about accepting or continuing client relationships and engagements, and the priorities that must not distort them.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-PERF\",\"en\":\"Engagement performance\",\"ar\":\"تنفيذ الارتباط\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 31 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 101\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Team responsibilities, direction and supervision, judgment and scepticism, consultation, differences of opinion, and documentation assembly and retention.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-RES\",\"en\":\"Resources\",\"ar\":\"الموارد\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 32 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 179\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Human, technological and intellectual resources and those from service providers, obtained, developed, assigned and used to enable quality.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-INFO\",\"en\":\"Information and communication\",\"ar\":\"المعلومات والاتصالات\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 33 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 28\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The information system, the culture of exchange, and communication within the firm and to external parties.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-RESP\",\"en\":\"Specified responses\",\"ar\":\"الاستجابات المحددة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 34 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 3\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The responses every firm must implement irrespective of its risk assessment.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-MON\",\"en\":\"Monitoring and remediation\",\"ar\":\"آلية المتابعة والتصحيح\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 35 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 40\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Monitoring activities including inspection of completed engagements, evaluation of findings and deficiencies, root cause analysis, remedial actions and communication.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-NET\",\"en\":\"Network requirements and services\",\"ar\":\"متطلبات الشبكة أو خدماتها\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 48 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 40\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Understanding, applying and evaluating network requirements and services, and monitoring performed by the network.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-EVAL\",\"en\":\"Evaluation of the system\",\"ar\":\"تقويم نظام إدارة الجودة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 53 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 19\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The annual point-in-time evaluation and conclusion by the individual with ultimate responsibility, and performance evaluations of leadership.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-QMC-DOC\",\"en\":\"Documentation\",\"ar\":\"التوثيق\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2023–2024 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by SOCPA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2025-04/2024 IAASB Handbook Vol 1 Arabic_0.pdf); ISQM 1 paragraph 57 heading; occurrences confirmed in the text: 127\",\"ar_needed\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Documentation of the system, its content and its retention.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISQM-1\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-RANDOM\",\"en\":\"Random selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Every sampling unit has an equal chance; selected with a documented seed so the selection is reproducible.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-SYSTEMATIC\",\"en\":\"Systematic (interval) selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A fixed interval through the population from a random start; monetary unit sampling is systematic selection over cumulative value.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-MUS\",\"en\":\"Monetary unit sampling\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Value-weighted systematic selection where each monetary unit is a sampling unit and larger items are more likely to be selected.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-STRATIFIED\",\"en\":\"Stratified random selection\",\"ar\":\"طبقية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Stratification\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The population is divided into strata with distinct characteristics and each stratum is sampled; results are evaluated per stratum and combined.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SM-ATTRIBUTE\",\"en\":\"Attribute sampling\",\"ar\":\"أخذ عينات الصفات\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Attribute sampling\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Selection sized and evaluated for a rate of deviation from a control, evaluated against the tolerable rate.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SM-HAPHAZARD\",\"en\":\"Haphazard selection\",\"ar\":\"أخذ عينات عشوائي غير منظم\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Haphazard selection\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Selection without a structured technique, avoiding conscious bias; conclusions extend to the population but the sampling risk is not measured.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-SM-BLOCK\",\"en\":\"Block selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Contiguous items selected together; rarely an appropriate sampling technique because most populations are structured so that items in sequence share characteristics.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-SPECIFIC\",\"en\":\"Specific item selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"High-value, key or unusual items selected by judgment; not sampling, so the results do not extend to the remainder of the population, which must be addressed separately.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-RISK-RANKED\",\"en\":\"Risk-ranked selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Items ranked by a scoring rule or a tool and selected from the top; non-statistical, and where the rule is a model the reproducibility of the ranking must be recorded with the evidence.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SM-COVERAGE\",\"en\":\"Coverage selection\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Items selected in descending value until a stated proportion of the population value is covered; not sampling, the remainder needs its own response.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-530\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-530 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-PERIOD-END\",\"en\":\"Entries at the period end\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Entries recorded in the days around the period end are where the timing of revenue, accruals and reserves is most easily manipulated.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-POST-CLOSE\",\"en\":\"Entries posted after close with an in-period effective date\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Post-closing entries change reported results after the books were thought final and are a recognised override vector.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-ROUND-AMOUNT\",\"en\":\"Round amounts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Estimates and fabricated entries tend to be round; genuine transactions rarely are.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-LARGE-AMOUNT\",\"en\":\"Amounts at or above a threshold\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Any single entry that could be material on its own is examined.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-UNUSUAL-ACCOUNT\",\"en\":\"Unusual or sensitive accounts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Suspense, intercompany, related-party, reserve and seldom-used accounts are where misstatements are parked.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-SELF-APPROVED\",\"en\":\"Self-approved or unapproved manual entries\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Segregation of duties fails when the preparer approves the entry or no approval is recorded.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-WEEKEND-HOLIDAY\",\"en\":\"Posted on non-working days\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Entries posted when no ordinary processing occurs deserve explanation; the working week is a parameter because Egypt's weekend is Friday and Saturday.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-OUT-OF-HOURS\",\"en\":\"Posted outside working hours\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Where a posting time exists, entries outside working hours are examined.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-MANUAL\",\"en\":\"Manual and top-side entries\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Entries not generated by a subledger or system interface are the population management can most easily use to override controls.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-UNUSUAL-USER\",\"en\":\"Entries by unusual users\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Entries prepared by senior management, IT personnel, leavers or generic accounts indicate override or access failures.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-NO-DESCRIPTION\",\"en\":\"Missing or minimal description\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry without a stated business purpose cannot be vouched from its face.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-KEYWORD\",\"en\":\"Keywords in the description\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Words that signal adjustment, reclassification, correction, write-off, bonus, management, or the names of related parties.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-REVERSAL-AFTER-PERIOD\",\"en\":\"Reversals after the period end\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry booked in the period and reversed after it may have existed only to move the result.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-SELDOM-USED-ACCOUNT\",\"en\":\"Seldom-used accounts\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Accounts with very few entries in the period are outside the normal processing flow.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-CONFIRMATION-REPLY\",\"en\":\"Confirmation reply received directly\",\"ar\":\"مصادقة خارجية\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"External confirmation\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A written reply from a third party received directly by the auditor (bank, customer, lawyer, custodian).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EK-EXTERNAL-DOCUMENT\",\"en\":\"External document held by the entity\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A document originated outside the entity but obtained from it (supplier invoice, bank statement, contract).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-ENTITY-REPORT\",\"en\":\"Report or listing produced by the entity\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Information produced by the entity's system whose accuracy and completeness must be evidenced before reliance (ISA 500.9).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-INSPECTION\",\"en\":\"Inspection record\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The auditor's record of inspecting a document, record or asset.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-OBSERVATION\",\"en\":\"Observation record\",\"ar\":\"ملاحظة\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Observation\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The auditor's record of observing a process or procedure being performed.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EK-INQUIRY\",\"en\":\"Inquiry record\",\"ar\":\"إستعلام (في سياق المعيار الدولي لعمليات المراجعة ( 2400المنقح))\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Inquiry\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The auditor's record of inquiries made and responses received.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EK-RECALCULATION\",\"en\":\"Recalculation or reperformance\",\"ar\":\"إعادة الحساب\",\"ar_status\":\"sourced_isa\",\"ar_tier\":1,\"ar_source\":\"Tier 1 — IAASB 2020 Handbook, Volume I, Arabic translation by IASCA, published by IFAC (public file ifacweb.blob.core.windows.net/publicfiles/2023-06/2020 IAASB HB_Vol 1_IASCA_AR_Secure_0.pdf), Glossary of Terms, entry \\\"Recalculation\\\"\",\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The auditor's independent recalculation or reperformance; reproducible from its inputs.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":null},{\"id\":\"T-EK-ANALYTICAL\",\"en\":\"Analytical procedure output\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Expectation, difference and threshold produced by a stated model from stated data; reproducible.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-SNIP\",\"en\":\"Source-document extract (snip)\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A region of a source document captured and cross-referenced to the working paper; evidence quality is that of the source.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-AUTOMATED-TOOL\",\"en\":\"Output of an automated tool or technique\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Information produced by software applied to a population (a ranking, a match, a screen); the record must state whether the output is reproducible from its inputs and, where a model is used, that it is not, so the evidence is weighed accordingly (ISA 500.A4–A5).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-DETERMINISTIC-COMPUTATION\",\"en\":\"Output of a deterministic computation\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Output of one of the computations in this repository or another pure function with published vectors; reproducible by construction.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-EK-LEDGER-PROOF\",\"en\":\"Ledger inclusion proof\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A Merkle inclusion proof for a ledger entry verified against a published root and certificate; population completeness as a verified property rather than a representation.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-500 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-AGREED\",\"en\":\"Agreed to source\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Amount or detail agreed to the source document named in the cross-reference.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-FOOTED\",\"en\":\"Footed\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Column total recalculated.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-CROSSFOOTED\",\"en\":\"Cross-footed\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Row totals recalculated across.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-TRACED\",\"en\":\"Traced\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Item traced from the source population into the accounting records (completeness direction).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-VOUCHED\",\"en\":\"Vouched\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Recorded item vouched to supporting evidence (existence/occurrence direction).\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-CONFIRMED\",\"en\":\"Confirmed\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Agreed to a confirmation reply received directly.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":null,\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-TM-RECALCULATED\",\"en\":\"Recalculated\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",