t in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-ACCOUNT-PAIR\",\"en\":\"Declared risky account pairs\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry that debits an account with one declared prefix and credits an account with another.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-BACKDATED\",\"en\":\"Backdated entries\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry whose effective date is more than the stated number of days before its posting date.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-SEQUENCE-GAP\",\"en\":\"Gaps in the entry sequence\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry whose number, taken from the trailing digits of its id, has no predecessor in the population.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-HIGH-VOLUME-USER\",\"en\":\"Users with unusually many entries\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry prepared by a user who prepared more than the stated number of entries.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-MANY-LINES\",\"en\":\"Entries with many lines\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry with more than the stated number of lines.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-PC-NO-REFERENCE\",\"en\":\"No document reference\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An entry none of whose lines carries a document reference.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-240\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-240 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage) — the term is not in the definitions paragraph or glossary consulted; check the application material.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-PROCEDURE-CONCLUSION\",\"en\":\"Procedure conclusion\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The recorded outcome of one planned procedure on an engagement: performed with or without exception, or not applicable with the reason; the unit of the audit programme's completion.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-300\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-COMPONENT-INSTRUCTION\",\"en\":\"Component auditor instruction\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The group auditor's written instruction to a component auditor: work requested, component materiality and threshold, significant risks, deadline.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-600\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-COMPONENT-REPORT\",\"en\":\"Component auditor report\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The component auditor's communication of results against an instruction, and the group auditor's evaluation of it.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-600\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-ADJUSTMENT\",\"en\":\"Adjusting entry\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A balanced set of legs over trial-balance accounts proposed by the auditor or booked by the client (adjusting, reclassifying, elimination or tax); booked, it changes the adjusted trial balance; waived, it stands as an uncorrected misstatement.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-450\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-C-ROLLFORWARD\",\"en\":\"Movement schedule roll-forward\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Reconciles a leadsheet's opening balance to its closing balance through its movements per component and compares the closing total with the leadsheet.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-PPE\",\"en\":\"Property, plant and equipment movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Cost and accumulated depreciation reconciled from the opening to the closing carrying amount.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-INTG\",\"en\":\"Intangible assets movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Cost and accumulated amortisation reconciled from the opening to the closing carrying amount.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-INVP\",\"en\":\"Investment property movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The carrying amount reconciled from the opening to the closing balance.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-INV\",\"en\":\"Inventories movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Each category of inventory reconciled from the opening to the closing balance, with the write-down provision.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-REC\",\"en\":\"Trade receivables movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Gross receivables and the loss allowance reconciled from the opening to the closing balance.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-AP\",\"en\":\"Trade payables movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Trade and other payables reconciled from the opening to the closing balance.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-BOR\",\"en\":\"Borrowings movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Principal and accrued interest reconciled from the opening to the closing balance, the reconciliation of liabilities arising from financing activities.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-SCH-RE\",\"en\":\"Retained earnings movement schedule\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"Retained earnings reconciled from the opening to the closing balance, one component of the statement of changes in equity.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-500\",\"ar_needed\":\"No ISA or ESA defines this term and the product glossary has no entry; supply from a reviewer who knows Egyptian audit practice and cite the source.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-CONTROL\",\"en\":\"Control\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A control relevant to the audit, recorded with its cycle, assertions, type, design and implementation conclusions, walkthrough, test of controls and result, and whether the audit relies on it.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-315\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-315 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage); the term appears in the definitions paragraph.\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-MINUTES-REVIEW\",\"en\":\"Minutes review\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"An extract of the minutes of a governance meeting read by the auditor, with the matter of audit significance it raises, its resolution, and the procedure it informs.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-315\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-315 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage).\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-MEETING-NOTE\",\"en\":\"Meeting note\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"The auditor's note of a meeting with management, those charged with governance or others: with whom, when, what was discussed, what was agreed, and the resolution of any significant matter raised.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-230\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-230 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage).\"},{\"id\":\"T-RK-CARRY-FORWARD\",\"en\":\"Matter carried forward\",\"ar\":\"\",\"ar_status\":\"pending_official_source\",\"ar_tier\":null,\"ar_source\":null,\"derived_from\":null,\"ar_alt\":null,\"ar_alt_source\":null,\"definition_en\":\"A matter noted for the next engagement, with the action the next audit should take, carried into the new file when the assembled file is rolled forward.\",\"definition_ar\":null,\"definition_ar_status\":\"pending_draft\",\"standard_id\":\"ISA-300\",\"ar_needed\":\"Official Arabic text of ISA-300 (SOCPA translation of the IAASB handbook on IFAC public storage).\"}]"),
    ("tick_marks", 13, "[{\"id\":\"TM-AGREED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-AGREED\",\"symbol\":\"✓\",\"name\":\"Agreed to source\",\"meaning\":\"Amount or detail agreed to the source document named in the cross-reference.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-EXTERNAL-DOCUMENT\",\"sort_order\":1},{\"id\":\"TM-FOOTED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-FOOTED\",\"symbol\":\"F\",\"name\":\"Footed\",\"meaning\":\"Column total recalculated.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-RECALCULATION\",\"sort_order\":2},{\"id\":\"TM-CROSSFOOTED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-CROSSFOOTED\",\"symbol\":\"CF\",\"name\":\"Cross-footed\",\"meaning\":\"Row totals recalculated across.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-RECALCULATION\",\"sort_order\":3},{\"id\":\"TM-TRACED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-TRACED\",\"symbol\":\"T\",\"name\":\"Traced\",\"meaning\":\"Item traced from the source population into the accounting records (completeness direction).\",\"evidence\":\"EK-INSPECTION\",\"sort_order\":4},{\"id\":\"TM-VOUCHED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-VOUCHED\",\"symbol\":\"V\",\"name\":\"Vouched\",\"meaning\":\"Recorded item vouched to supporting evidence (existence/occurrence direction).\",\"evidence\":\"EK-INSPECTION\",\"sort_order\":5},{\"id\":\"TM-CONFIRMED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-CONFIRMED\",\"symbol\":\"C\",\"name\":\"Confirmed\",\"meaning\":\"Agreed to a confirmation reply received directly.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-CONFIRMATION-REPLY\",\"sort_order\":6},{\"id\":\"TM-RECALCULATED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-RECALCULATED\",\"symbol\":\"R\",\"name\":\"Recalculated\",\"meaning\":\"Amount independently recalculated.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-RECALCULATION\",\"sort_order\":7},{\"id\":\"TM-OBSERVED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-OBSERVED\",\"symbol\":\"O\",\"name\":\"Observed\",\"meaning\":\"Process or count observed.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-OBSERVATION\",\"sort_order\":8},{\"id\":\"TM-INQUIRED\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-INQUIRED\",\"symbol\":\"I\",\"name\":\"Inquired\",\"meaning\":\"Explanation obtained by inquiry; corroboration referenced separately.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-INQUIRY\",\"sort_order\":9},{\"id\":\"TM-GL\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-GL\",\"symbol\":\"GL\",\"name\":\"Agreed to general ledger\",\"meaning\":\"Agreed to the general ledger or trial balance.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-ENTITY-REPORT\",\"sort_order\":10},{\"id\":\"TM-PY\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-PY\",\"symbol\":\"PY\",\"name\":\"Agreed to prior year\",\"meaning\":\"Agreed to the prior-period working papers or audited statements.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-ENTITY-REPORT\",\"sort_order\":11},{\"id\":\"TM-PROOF\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-PROOF\",\"symbol\":\"⛓\",\"name\":\"Inclusion proof verified\",\"meaning\":\"Entry verified against the ledger root by the verifier.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-LEDGER-PROOF\",\"sort_order\":12},{\"id\":\"TM-NA\",\"term_id\":\"T-TM-NA\",\"symbol\":\"n/a\",\"name\":\"Not applicable\",\"meaning\":\"Procedure not applicable to the item, with the reason stated.\",\"evidence\":\"EK-INSPECTION\",\"sort_order\":13}]"),
    ("profile:eta-einvoicing-documents", 1, "{\"system\":\"eta_einvoicing\",\"description\":\"Egyptian Tax Authority e-invoicing portal document export (JSON array of documents as returned by the document search API, or the portal CSV). This source holds documents, not balances: the adapter produces the documents population and a trial-balance FRAGMENT of revenue, output VAT and receivables control totals, flagged as partial. It never claims to be a full trial balance.\",\"format\":\"json\",\"document_fields\":{\"document_id\":[\"internalId\",\"internalID\"],\"external_uuid\":[\"uuid\"],\"date\":[\"dateTimeIssued\",\"issueDate\"],\"kind_from\":{\"field\":\"documentType\",\"map\":{\"I\":\"sales_invoice\",\"i\":\"sales_invoice\",\"C\":\"sales_credit_note\",\"c\":\"sales_credit_note\",\"D\":\"purchase_debit_note\",\"d\":\"purchase_debit_note\"}},\"counterparty_id\":[\"receiverId\",\"receiver.id\"],\"counterparty_name\":[\"receiverName\",\"receiver.name\"],\"net_amount\":[\"netAmount\"],\"tax_amount\":[\"totalTaxAmount\",\"taxTotals\"],\"total_amount\":[\"totalAmount\",\"totalAmount\"],\"status\":{\"field\":\"status\",\"map\":{\"Valid\":\"valid\",\"Cancelled\":\"cancelled\",\"Rejected\":\"rejected\",\"Submitted\":\"submitted\"}}},\"fragment_accounts\":{\"revenue\":{\"account_code\":\"ETA-REV\",\"account_name\":\"Revenue per accepted e-invoices\",\"leadsheet_override\":\"LS-REV\"},\"vat\":{\"account_code\":\"ETA-VAT\",\"account_name\":\"Output VAT per accepted e-invoices\",\"leadsheet_override\":\"LS-VAT\"},\"receivables\":{\"account_code\":\"ETA-REC\",\"account_name\":\"Gross invoiced amount per accepted e-invoices\",\"leadsheet_override\":\"LS-REC\"}},\"partial\":true,\"id\":\"eta-einvoicing-documents\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:odoo-trial-balance", 1, "{\"system\":\"odoo\",\"description\":\"Odoo Accounting > Reporting > Trial Balance exported to XLSX/CSV. Columns: Code, Account, Initial Balance Debit/Credit, Debit, Credit, End Balance Debit/Credit.\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"delimiter\":\",\",\"header_row\":\"auto\",\"header_signature\":[\"Code\",\"Account\"],\"skip_rows_matching\":[\"^Total\",\"^$\"],\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"Code\"],\"account_name\":[\"Account\",\"Name\"],\"opening_debit\":[\"Initial Balance Debit\",\"Initial Debit\"],\"opening_credit\":[\"Initial Balance Credit\",\"Initial Credit\"],\"period_debit\":[\"Debit\"],\"period_credit\":[\"Credit\"],\"debit\":[\"End Balance Debit\",\"Ending Debit\"],\"credit\":[\"End Balance Credit\",\"Ending Credit\"]},\"amount_rules\":{\"thousands_separator\":\",\",\"decimal_separator\":\".\",\"negative_formats\":[\"-1.00\"],\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"odoo-trial-balance\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:quickbooks-online-trial-balance", 1, "{\"system\":\"quickbooks\",\"description\":\"QuickBooks Online report Trial Balance exported to CSV (Reports > Trial Balance > Export). Header rows carry the company name and period; the account column holds the account name, optionally prefixed by the account number when numbering is enabled.\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8-sig\",\"delimiter\":\",\",\"header_row\":\"auto\",\"header_signature\":[\"Debit\",\"Credit\"],\"skip_rows_matching\":[\"^TOTAL\",\"^$\"],\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"Account number\"],\"account_name\":[\"Account\",\"Account name\",\"col0\"],\"debit\":[\"Debit\"],\"credit\":[\"Credit\"]},\"account_code_from_name\":{\"pattern\":\"^(\\\\d[\\\\w.\\\\-]*)\\\\s+(.*)$\",\"code_group\":1,\"name_group\":2},\"amount_rules\":{\"thousands_separator\":\",\",\"decimal_separator\":\".\",\"negative_formats\":[\"-1.00\"],\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"quickbooks-online-trial-balance\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:sage-50-trial-balance", 1, "{\"system\":\"sage\",\"description\":\"Sage 50 General Ledger Trial Balance report exported to CSV. Columns: Account ID, Account Description, Debit Amt, Credit Amt.\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8-sig\",\"delimiter\":\",\",\"header_row\":\"auto\",\"header_signature\":[\"Account ID\"],\"skip_rows_matching\":[\"^Total\",\"^$\"],\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"Account ID\",\"Nominal code\",\"N/C\"],\"account_name\":[\"Account Description\",\"Name\"],\"debit\":[\"Debit Amt\",\"Debit\"],\"credit\":[\"Credit Amt\",\"Credit\"]},\"amount_rules\":{\"thousands_separator\":\",\",\"decimal_separator\":\".\",\"negative_formats\":[\"-1.00\",\"(1.00)\"],\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"sage-50-trial-balance\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:sap-fagl-account-balances", 1, "{\"system\":\"sap\",\"description\":\"SAP S/4HANA or ECC G/L account balance export (report S_ALR_87012277 or Fiori Display G/L Account Balances) saved as CSV. Amounts may use the SAP trailing-minus convention.\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8\",\"delimiter\":\";\",\"header_row\":\"auto\",\"header_signature\":[\"G/L Account\",\"G/L acct\"],\"skip_rows_matching\":[\"^\\\\*\",\"^$\"],\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"G/L Account\",\"G/L acct\",\"Account\"],\"account_name\":[\"Long Text\",\"Short Text\",\"G/L Account Long Text\",\"Description\"],\"opening_debit\":[\"Balance carryforward debit\"],\"opening_credit\":[\"Balance carryforward credit\"],\"period_debit\":[\"Debit\",\"Total debit\",\"Debit balance\"],\"period_credit\":[\"Credit\",\"Total credit\",\"Credit balance\"],\"balance\":[\"Accumulated balance\",\"Balance\",\"Cumulative balance\"]},\"amount_rules\":{\"thousands_separator\":\".\",\"decimal_separator\":\",\",\"negative_formats\":[\"1,00-\",\"-1,00\"],\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"sap-fagl-account-balances\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:spreadsheet-generic-csv", 1, "{\"system\":\"spreadsheet\",\"description\":\"Any CSV or XLSX export with one row per account. Column names are matched case-insensitively after trimming; the first matching alias wins.\",\"encoding\":\"utf-8-sig\",\"delimiter\":\",\",\"header_row\":1,\"skip_rows_matching\":[\"^total\",\"^grand total\",\"^$\"],\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"account_code\",\"code\",\"account\",\"account number\",\"acct\"],\"account_name\":[\"account_name\",\"name\",\"description\",\"account description\"],\"debit\":[\"debit\",\"dr\",\"debit balance\",\"debit amt\"],\"credit\":[\"credit\",\"cr\",\"credit balance\",\"credit amt\"],\"prior_debit\":[\"prior_debit\",\"py debit\",\"prior year debit\"],\"prior_credit\":[\"prior_credit\",\"py credit\",\"prior year credit\"],\"balance\":[\"balance\",\"net\",\"amount\"]},\"amount_rules\":{\"thousands_separator\":\",\",\"decimal_separator\":\".\",\"negative_formats\":[\"-1.00\",\"(1.00)\",\"1.00-\"],\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"spreadsheet-generic-csv\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
    ("profile:thebes-ledger-core", 1, "{\"system\":\"thebes_ledger_core\",\"description\":\"Trial balance projection from thebes-ledger-core: the fold over posted journal entries for a period, each line carrying an MMR inclusion proof for the entries that compose it. The adapter carries the proof verbatim and sets evidence_grade to cryptographic only when every line carries a proof; verification is delegated to the ledger verifier.\",\"format\":\"json\",\"columns\":{\"account_code\":[\"account_code\"],\"account_name\":[\"account_name\"],\"debit\":[\"debit\"],\"credit\":[\"credit\"],\"prior_debit\":[\"prior_debit\"],\"prior_credit\":[\"prior_credit\"],\"proof\":[\"proof\"]},\"amount_rules\":{\"decimal_separator\":\".\",\"balance_sign\":\"debit_positive\"},\"id\":\"thebes-ledger-core\",\"profile_version\":\"1.0\"}"),
  ];

  public func table(name : Text) : ?Text {
    for ((k, _, v) in TABLES.vals()) { if (k == name) return ?v };
    null
  };
};
